/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (Bionic Prosthetics & Orthotics recently attended the Tennessee State O&P Meeting in Johnson City, Tennessee, where professionals from across the region gathered to share knowledge, collaborate, and discuss the future of the orthotics and prosthetics industry. The event provided an opportunity for team members to reconnect with industry colleagues, build new relationships, and gain insight into emerging technologies and advancements shaping the future of O&P care.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
