139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (A highlight of the event was connecting with East Tennessee State University's growing O&P program and its graduating class. Supporting the next generation of clinicians is an important part of Bionic's mission, and we look forward to exploring future partnerships that provide students with valuable educational, clinical, and career opportunities. By investing in professional development, industry engagement, and future talent, Bionic continues to strengthen its commitment to both its employees and the patients they serve.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
