/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (Experiences like these reflect Bionic Prosthetics & Orthotics' commitment to improving lives beyond the clinic. By supporting adaptive sports and community initiatives, our team gains a deeper understanding of the goals and aspirations of the individuals we serve. This commitment to patient-centered care, community involvement, and helping people achieve greater independence is what continues to make Bionic a meaningful place to grow, serve, and make an impact.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 109 0 R
/E (Our team recently had the opportunity to attend the Chicago Adaptive Golf Outing, where we witnessed firsthand the determination, skill, and resilience of adaptive athletes on the course. The event brought together golfers from a variety of backgrounds, all demonstrating that physical challenges are no barrier to competition, achievement, and enjoyment of the game. Beyond the golf itself, the outing provided valuable opportunities to connect with patients, community partners, and advocates who share a passion for helping individuals stay active and engaged in the activities they love.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
